cancelled. 

Probels with llm-serever integration:-
we need a way to cancel a running request with the server- either steraming
or non streaming. Otherwise if a a remote request was runnong for adapter B
and user made a lcoal request for adapter B then user has to for the server
to hot swap the adapter which can only happen after the remote request is done.
Therefore we need a way to cancel request made to ai server.

